 shard C / numeral form ..... MMXXV

 conversion table (only the values you need):
     I = 1     V = 5     X = 10     L = 50     C = 100     D = 500     M = 1000

 shard C / decimal form ..... ____   (you do the arithmetic)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ASSEMBLY RULE  (record 04 only)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
     shard A ........ day      (interface, shown as a hex literal)
     shard B ........ month    (interface, hidden in the markup -- not the pixels)
     shard C ........ year     (this file, roman numerals)

     FLAG{ <DAY>_<MONTH>_<YEAR> }

     DAY and MONTH are two digits. YEAR is four digits. Underscores between.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 CONTEXT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 This is not a birthday.
 This is not an anniversary of the ordinary sort.
 One person asked a question on this date and the answer was yes.

